{
  "id": 295,
  "description": "*Plague, Where Brotherhood Meets Battle*\n\nHere at Plague, the guild is everything. We’re not just players – we’re a family, bound by a common goal: to conquer the wildest monsters, complete the most challenging guild quests, and raid with unstoppable force. Here, teamwork is the key to victory, and every member plays a vital role in our shared success.\n\nWhat we’re about:\n- **Slay Monsters, Claim Glory** – From towering beasts to hidden threats, we hunt and train skills together. Every kill is a triumph and every skill item is a win!\n\n- **Guild Quests = Guild Strength** – Complete challenges that unite us and strengthen the bond between every member. The guild’s growth is your growth!\n\n- **Raid Ready, Always** – Gear up and join our daily raids. We dive deep and emerge victorious together!\n\n- **True Guild Unity** – This is a place where relationships matter. We support each other, learn from each other, and grow stronger with each quest completed!\n\nIf you’re looking for a home where your effort counts, where your guild is your family, and where every victory is a team effort, then Plague is your place!\n\nPlease be active, have fun, try to complete raids and challenges. Our guild raids are aimed at players between levels 20-60 and mainly start at 18:30UTC but we try and complete an earlier one if possible.\n\nCome and join the fun, we welcome all!",
